 "schema": 1,
 "note": "Expression tags for Fish Audio S2 Pro and Drama 3, collected from the vendors' public model cards and documentation (retrieved 2026-10-15). Only short tag names (facts) are listed, no vendor text. Tags are free-form natural language: the models accept tags that are not in this list; the list feeds the editor's picker and the LLM prompt, and tags outside it are kept but flagged. Refresh with tools/fish_tags.py.",
 "syntax": {
  "inline": "[tag]",
  "placement": "A tag stands where the effect should happen. Emotion cues work best at the start of a sentence; tone and sound tags can go anywhere; put 'emphasis' right before the word. Combine at most three per sentence.",
